            "review_title": "Review at Cafe Sân Vườn Miền Thảo Mộc",
            "review_text": "SwennySG\nSingapore, Singapore637 contributions\n0\nA peaceful garden escape in the heart of the city\nJun 2025 • Friends\nA beautiful spot with lush greenery, tranquil water features, and plenty of cozy corners to relax. The garden setting feels like a hidden oasis—perfect for catching up with friends or enjoying a quiet moment alone. The drinks menu is extensive, with everything from Vietnamese coffee to smoothies and herbal teas. I especially appreciated the friendly staff and the variety of indoor and outdoor seating. It can get busy on weekends, but the atmosphere is worth it. A lovely place to unwind and recharge.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 29, 2025",
